            <div id="Main" class="full-width--copy">
                <main class="content-width--copy flxg-row">
                    <article class="main-copy flxg-col flxg-col--12 large-flxg-col--12">
                        <div class="product-copy-row flxg-row">
                            <div class="product-copy flxg-col flxg-col--12 medium-flxg-col--8 large-flxg-col--9">
                                <h1>About CAMaster</h1>
                                <div class="wysiwyg-area wysiwyg-area--brand-detail">
                                    <h1>Used CAMaster CNC Routers for Sale</h1>
<p><strong>Resell CNC is your Simple. Reliable. and Trusted.&reg; source for used CAMaster CNC routers</strong> &mdash; including Stinger entry-level and mid-range routers, Panther industrial-grade ATC routers, Cobra and Cobra Elite heavy-duty production routers, and all associated accessories including vacuum systems, HSD spindles, drill banks, rotary indexing lathes, and laser engraving attachments. We carry CAMaster models across the full product range, from compact Stinger 4x4 routers through Panther 5x10 ATC machines and Cobra Elite production systems with 12 or 16 HP spindles.</p>
<p>CAMaster was an American manufacturer of CNC routers, founded in 2008 in Cartersville, Georgia. All CAMaster machines were designed and built in the USA with heavy all-steel welded frames, HSD Italian-made spindles, THK precision linear rails, and AC digital servo drives. The company offered what was at the time the industry's only two-year warranty and provided virtual technician live online support. CAMaster built a loyal following among woodworkers, sign makers, cabinet shops, and small manufacturers through its Stinger, Panther, and Cobra product lines before ceasing operations in late 2025. A significant number of CAMaster routers remain in active production use across North America, and the machines continue to hold value on the used market due to their quality construction and use of industry-standard components.</p>
<p><strong>Looking to sell your CAMaster?</strong> Resell CNC buys used CAMaster routers nationwide, any model, any generation, any condition. Free appraisal within 24 hours, competitive offers, and we handle all rigging and transportation. Call <a href="tel:8444788181"><strong>(844) 478-8181</strong></a> or email <a href="mailto:sales@resellcnc.com"><strong>sales@resellcnc.com</strong></a>.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="product-logos flxg-col flxg-col--12 medium-flxg-col--4 large-flxg-col--3">
                                <figure class="brand-detail-page__logo-container">
                                    <img src="../../FileRepository/Brands/65f4447c-ef86-48d1-8334-63dec7b65639.jpg" alt="CAMaster Logo" class="brand-detail-page__logo" />
                                </figure>
                                <a href='/sell-used-cnc-equipment/Default.aspx?Make=CAMaster' title="Sell Your CAMaster to ReSellCNC" class="btn--primary btn--brand-detail-sell"><span>Sell My CAMaster</span></a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </main>
