            <div class="full-width--copy">
                <div class="content-width--copy flxg-row">
                    <article class="main-copy flxg-col flxg-col--12 large-flxg-col--12">
                        <div class="product-copy-row flxg-row">
                            <div class="product-copy flxg-col flxg-col--12 medium-flxg-col--8 large-flxg-col--8">
                                <div class="wysiwyg-area wysiwyg-area--brand-detail">
                                    <p style="text-align:center; background:#fff3e6; padding:15px; border-left:4px solid #f47920;"><strong>Don't see the CAMaster router you're looking for?</strong><br />
New inventory arrives daily. <a href="/_create-alert/">Create a free alert</a> and we'll notify you the moment a matching CAMaster hits our inventory. Or call <a href="tel:8444788181"><strong>(844) 478-8181</strong></a> &mdash; our team sources specific CAMaster models on request.</p>
<h2>Stinger Series (Entry &amp; Mid-Range)</h2>
<p>The Stinger series was CAMaster's entry-level and mid-range CNC router lineup. The base Stinger is available in 4x4 and 4x8 ft table sizes with a 3.5 HP variable-speed router and heavy-duty steel frame construction. The Stinger II expands to 24 or 36-inch cutting widths. The Stinger III adds larger capacity with up to 24,000 RPM spindle speed. The Stinger ATC variant includes an automatic tool changer for multi-tool operations. Digital stepper drives with anti-backlash systems are standard, with optional servo upgrades, HSD spindle upgrades, vacuum hold-down, laser engraving, and rotary indexing lathe attachments available.</p>
<h2>Panther Series (Industrial)</h2>
<p>The Panther series is CAMaster's industrial-grade ATC router, available in 4x4, 4x8, and 5x10 ft configurations (PT-408, PT-508, PT-510). Standard features include a 5 or 6 HP HSD ATC spindle with 8-position automatic tool changer, helical rack and pinion drive, digital servo motors with planetary gearboxes, phenolic vacuum tabletop, and pop-up locating pins for quick material positioning. Optional features include tangential knives, vision registration cameras, and laser engravers.</p>
<h2>Cobra Series (Heavy-Duty Production)</h2>
<p>The Cobra and Cobra Elite are CAMaster's heavy-duty production routers built for high-volume manufacturing. Cobra Elite models feature HSD ATC spindles in 5 HP (ISO-30), 12 HP (ISO-30), or 16 HP (HSK-63F) configurations with 10-tool linear racks or rotary carousels. The Cobra Elite uses Yaskawa SmartCore CNC automation. All-steel welded construction with THK 25 mm precision rails ensures rigidity and accuracy under demanding continuous-duty production cycles. Drill banks (5 or 9 position) are available for high-speed boring operations.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
