            <td style="padding:8px 12px;">HSD spindles (Italy), THK rails, Yaskawa SmartCore (Cobra Elite), AC servos</td>
        </tr>
        <tr style="background:#f5f5f5;">
            <td style="padding:8px 12px; font-weight:bold;">Industries Served</td>
            <td style="padding:8px 12px;">Woodworking, cabinetry, sign making, architectural millwork, plastics, aluminum, education</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
<p style="text-align:center; margin:18px 0 10px 0;"><a href="/sell-used-cnc-equipment/"><img src="/FileRepository/Content/Images/Sell%20Your%20Camaster.png" alt="Sell Your CAMaster — Get a Free Appraisal" style="max-width:280px;" /></a></p>
